  "instructions": [
    "Cook the noodles according to package instructions.",
    "Cut the tofu into small cubes and set aside.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the yeast and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the oyster sauce, ferment-jang, and soy sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and toss to coat with the sauce.",
    "Add the tofu to the skillet and cook for 2-3 minutes, until heated through.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional scallions if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
